### 1. What problem does this project solve?

**Interview-ready answer:**  
The project automates and supports customer-support ticket triage. It uses ticket text and customer metadata to predict the ticket category, priority, and estimated resolution time. The goal is to help support teams route tickets faster and improve operational visibility through an EDA dashboard.

**Technical concept:**  
