### 26. Why use TF-IDF?

**Interview-ready answer:**  
TF-IDF represents words according to how important they are to a document relative to the corpus. It reduces the influence of very common words and highlights terms that help distinguish ticket categories.

The baseline pipeline uses `TfidfVectorizer(stop_words="english", max_features=5000)`.

**Technical concept:**  
